//RS     /// D-DBG3 step 2 (I2): translate a raw Rust local/param name back to its
//RS     /// Jet spelling. Codegen's `mangle()` (`crates/jet-codegen/src/Codegen/mod.rs`)
//RS     /// prefixes every non-`main` binding with `__jet_`; strip it. Names without
